'''Gross!!!''' (キモモモ, ''Kimomomo'', '''Grossssss''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 2.

==Effect==
"Freeze" Effect UP (M): Freeze duration is increased by 20%.

